    "SPARK — S167: atlas specs for the SIX TIER-9 TOWER DESTRUCTION CINEMATICS.",
    "",
    "⭐ SEPARATE FROM atlas-specs.json ON PURPOSE. framesPerState is a per-spec value, so one file",
    "cannot hold both the three STILL conditions (framesPerState 1) and this ANIMATED row (12).",
    "",
    "⚠ fit 'box' and cellW/cellH 256 to match the tower stills EXACTLY — the destroy row replaces the",
    "sprite it grew out of, and a height-fit would scale a collapsing wide ruin differently from the",
    "intact building, so the tower would visibly jump size at the moment it starts to fall.",
    "",
    "⚠ normaliseStateScale is NOT set: there is only ONE state here, so there is nothing to normalise",
    "against, and the whole point of a collapse is that the subject legitimately CHANGES size."
